分かりにくい箇所は描きやすいようにアレンジして頂いて構いません！  \n\n▼用途  個人鑑賞、他の方へのskebを送る時の資料としての添付。金額や不足が描くのが難しい等ありましたらキャンセルしていただいて構いません。どうぞよろしくお願いいたします…！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1MUpzw4v_OmndzPw4DiTGfu8YdnnyMoti?usp=drive_link", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@natuomitakahashi/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/4db9b484/uploads/origins/66369989-1ff8-4aa4-a789-8fb3f3a872ed?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=2867d27e2d6735915c0277beb56676c7", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4db9b484/uploads/origins/66369989-1ff8-4aa4-a789-8fb3f3a872ed?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=2867d27e2d6735915c0277beb56676c7, https://si.imgix.net/4db9b484/uploads/origins/66369989-1ff8-4aa4-a789-8fb3f3a872ed?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=23b2757a2827c8769161c456a7ba2c6d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/4db9b484/uploads/origins/66369989-1ff8-4aa4-a789-8fb3f3a872ed?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=f43923a16935b439d00d23a989cbb4db 3x"}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 4121039, "nc": 129}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 769057, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "あまるん（ペンギン）", "screen_name": "amarun_penguin", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1519449645113511936/04cJr3AD.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/3166156982/1640387432/1500x500", "appeal_receiv